  "body": "The offline W3 implementation is independently **ACCEPTED** at `b961d20ce4a803e55336fb5590c30574e23b2fad`. It adds immutable externally approved references, true metric queries, continuous geometry/dynamics revalidation, atomic publication and existing nine-group ROS JSON/CDR export in the declared synthetic planar offline scope.\n\nIndependent remediation fixed positive squared-speed cancellation near profile boundaries, with failing-first public publish/load evidence and coefficient/interior/closing-edge regressions. Previously added trusted publication ancestry, timeout evidence retention and bounded legacy-fit classification remain preserved. No accepted W2 geometry, q authority, policy tolerance or numerical bound was relaxed.\n\nValidation on the final literal source: **612 functional tests in 27 groups**, zero functional failures/errors/skips; a complete fresh non-symlink installation and separate source-free five-test/nine-scenario campaign; all 30 intended ordinary/source-free negative controls; independently inspected installed imports/resources and actual reader/CDR. Ten inherited legacy failures and two copyright skips remain separately recorded with the exact diagnostic multiset. Independent high-precision oracles cover 4,442 queries and 496 strict endpoints. Nine unchanged authenticated hosted products also pass real installed dual-validator replay with exact retained H/C and frozen producer T.\n\n- [Final exact-head push CI](https://github.com/Felix-Grote/race_stack/actions/runs/39110306747)\n- [Final PR CI](https://github.com/Felix-Grote/race_stack/actions/runs/39110310707)\n- [Full final96 campaign](https://github.com/Felix-Grote/race_stack/actions/runs/39110811058): workflow harness7fcecd9 independently checks out numerical sourceb961; 58PASS, 28stock preparation failures, 8resource limits and 2conditioning failures.\n- [Independent acceptance report and complete durable archive](https://github.com/Felix-Grote/race_stack/blob/4b222ff37101c72d79cd6da0467a562214817d79/docs/project_a/evidence/w3-independent-final/README.md)\n- [Exact accepted source tag](https://github.com/Felix-Grote/race_stack/tree/project-a/w3-accepted-b961d20)\n\nS6 succeeds only for the declared synthetic input/policy (including explicit0.52m mesh); conditioning, point-budget and origin/scale sensitivity remain documented. Adapted legacy certificates do not approve native legacy geometry. There is no optimum, general competition-scale robustness, real-course, calibrated-vehicle or physical driving claim.\n\nThis PR closes the complete research/development product on the personal fork. A separate clean branch from current official `ForzaETH/race_stack:ros2-humble` will carry the lean runtime, required configuration/packaging and curated tests, linking this archive without importing research history. The official production PR requires separate integration verification and maintainer review.\n",
